/gradlew
/gradlew.bat
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# EXCEPTION: the dedicated staging DEBUG keystore is committed on purpose. It
# only ever signs --staging dev/test builds (never a store release) and carries
# no release trust, exactly like Android's shared default debug keystore — but
# with a distinct SHA-1 so ayma-staging can own its own Android OAuth client for
# Google sign-in. See docs/STAGING.md "Google Sign-In: dedicated staging keystore".
!ayma-staging-debug.keystore
